OL,3,GNEWSARoad to partly reopen following
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road which has remained closed for
OL,7,Fmore than a week after a building site
OL,8,Fpartially collapsed is set to partly
OL,9,Freopen.
OL,11,FTwo people were taken to hospital after
OL,12,Fan apartment block under construction
OL,13,Fpartly collapsed alongside scaffolding
OL,14,Fon the A4260 Cherwell Street in
OL,15,FBanbury, Oxfordshire, on 21 October.
OL,17,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,18,Fpreviously said it was investigating
OL,19,Fthe incident, and its inspectors had
OL,20,Fvisited the site as part of its
OL,21,Finquiries.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
