OL,3,GNEWSARoad to partly reopen following
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe key route has remained totally
OL,7,Fclosed since the incident, but
OL,8,FOxfordshire County Council said that
OL,9,Fwould change over the weekend.
